FEATURE SUMMARY — what's actually built
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

- **Login** — separate step from upload, own button
- **Profiles** — editable name/bio/photo, public profile view, guestbook,
  activity heatmap (GitHub-style, shows daily upload streaks)
- **Privacy** — display name shown everywhere, email never shown publicly
- **Gallery** — everyone sees everyone's approved work
- **Live Community** — "Signed In Now" + real-time Live Chat, same shared
  room visible in Marketplace, Uploader, and Admin (read-only there);
  name changes broadcast live, no refresh needed
- **Admin** — Pending / Published / Rejected / Community tabs, manual
  Digital-or-Physical override per item, RLS-aware error messages
- **Publish pipeline** — auto-tries Digital product first (patches a
  pre-made hidden template, never calls the blocked CREATE-digital
  endpoint), falls back to Physical only when manually approved through
  admin (auto-publish-on-upload never creates Physical without review)
- **Auto-publish on upload** — if a Digital template is available, a
  brand new upload can go live immediately, no admin step needed
- **Interfaz Studio** — 37 windows, every one has a green refresh dot
  (reloads just that window), tomatoes/corner springs, audio tools
  grouped into one dock bubble, K.O. II live broadcast, Now Drop It
  15-min auto-refresh with pause/skip/cancel, phone-only entry restricted
  to Now Drop It + Upload (iPad/desktop/laptop unaffected)

